Ops-day batches (from ops day 2026-11-05 onward): each ops day has three segments, A / B / C (`batch_phase` 1 / 2 / 3). A starts at the ops-day open (16:30 ET from ops day 2026-11-09; was 19:30). From 23:10 ET every scrape checks Slot Assignment for B; if unchanged keep scraping A; when Batch No changes that run scrapes A once more and B for the first time, then stops Slot checks until morning. From 06:10 ET every scrape checks Slot for C; if unchanged keep scraping B; when Batch No changes that run scrapes B once more and C for the first time, then stops Slot checks until the next ops-day open. C's last scrape is 16:10 ET from ops day 2026-11-09.

